      "value": "Avatar doesn't need FT support to experience the this bug\n\nSeems some suitably large animators (by parameter count?) hits this bug\n\nThis random public avatar I switched into below dropped my frames from 100+ to 2fps when the debug menu is opened\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_b77090cc-0b9b-431f-b189-f7a3c3446a0d",
